{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55116","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看岁月，冲破时（辛本、川本、京本作「下」）推之。\n上将行年居此位（辛本、川本、京本作「下」），师行（辛本、京本作「侯」）身必有凶危，禳厌始无亏。\n（月将加所得之时，看支干上见魁罡星者主惊溃。\n将帅行年上见魁罡者宜禳之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}